WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:27.840
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:28.600
What do you want?

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.560
What are you doing?

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:30.840
Let go of me!

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.360
Let go!

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.040
Let me go!

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:54.800
Let go!

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:22.000
=Ren Yu=

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.220
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:27.220
=Episode 5=

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.080
Stay away from me!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.680
Stay away!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.320
What are you looking at? Get lost!

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.560
Mind your own business.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.480
Where's Su Lin?

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.560
What do you think?

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:17.000
Ting.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.440
Why are you spacing out?

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:20.400
Why aren't you home?

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.440
I forgot one of my assignments.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.800
I was thinking of asking a classmate.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.800
Eat dinner first.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:29.960
We can talk after.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:33.240
You're out of it.

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:40.840
How did your backpack get ripped?

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.000
What happened?

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:46.760
Answer me!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.840
How'd you damage your new backpack?

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.280
I'm asking you!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.400
You hit me!

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.240
You wasteful brat!

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.520
I'll beat you senseless!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.480
Beat you!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.600
I'll beat you up!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:00.880
Don't run!

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.840
You destroyed a brand-new backpack!

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.120
What family can afford

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.160
to let you...

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:05.800
Enough, Su.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.520
ruin things like this?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:11.600
Su.

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.400
They say mischievous boys

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:16.920
are smart.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.000
He's way too mischievous.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.040
Look at this new backpack.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.600
It's already like this.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.080
Come on. Let's go home.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.680
No!

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:27.920
Let's go home.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:29.680
Come on.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:30.360
You'll hit me.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.240
I won't.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:32.800
Come on.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:34.400
Come on.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.440
Should've used your sister's old one.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:40.360
Don't you care

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.080
how much my money is worth?

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.000
They called me names.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.720
I got mad, so I hit them.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.160
And that wrecked your backpack?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.000
I hit them with it.

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.680
Know how much that backpack cost?

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:56.960
They called me names.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.640
Even if they did...

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.840
It made me mad.

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:09.960
It's so dark.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:11.360
Can you even see?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.000
Didn't I tell you?

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.200
Drink your milk while it's warm.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:24.600
Hey.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.080
Didn't you hear me?

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.240
You need to drink it warm.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.920
Now I have to warm this up for you.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:34.560
Fine.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.280
What are you doing? Homework?

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:42.320
With that?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.520
I... just forgot.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:46.920
All right, stop.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:47.920
Leave it for now.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:49.120
Come here.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.600
Turn around.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:57.400
What happened?

00:06:58.320 --> 00:06:59.400
Did you have a problem

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.920
with a classmate

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.440
or a teacher?

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:03.440
No.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.040
No?

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.120
What do you mean?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.080
What is it?

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:14.960
Mom.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.640
Ever since I was little,

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.560
you've told me to be responsible.

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.800
So if I

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:28.880
didn't stand up for someone,

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.560
didn't return something I found,

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.920
or didn't help someone in need,

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:43.800
does that make me a bad person?

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.280
I thought it was something serious.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.560
That's all?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.760
Those are just principles.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.320
Principles are one thing.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.440
They shouldn't become a burden.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:56.200
The question is,

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.760
do you know what you did wrong?

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.800
It's okay to mess up this time.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:02.880
Find the reason,

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.440
and you'll do better next time.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.760
High standards are a good thing.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:08.520
Find out-

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:09.320
But I don't want to.

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:10.640
But what?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.240
It's fine. I understand.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.520
What do you mean?

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:19.320
Come here.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:20.600
Come listen to me.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.920
You must've fought with a classmate.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.000
You had a falling-out.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:25.800
No, I didn't.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.520
I'll do my homework.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.520
Forget the homework.

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:37.520
Why bother right now?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:40.160
You're getting none of it right.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.240
Clear your head.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:43.440
Your yellow leather shoes are dirty.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.160
Go polish them.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.880
Go on. Clear your head.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.080
Can you get it right like this?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.480
Accuracy is what matters.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.200
Do it properly later.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.000
(Su Lin)

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:24.120
Su Lin.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:27.280
(What are you looking at? Get lost!)

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:36.720
Mom.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.960
This pencil case...

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.120
Where's this pencil case from?

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:43.200
I found it by the flower bed.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:43.920
Why?

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.640
Why isn't the compass in it?

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:46.560
A compass?

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:47.920
What compass?

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.000
Then

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:52.600
did you see

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.280
who lost it that day?

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:55.480
No.

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:58.280
Was it one of your classmates?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.080
I didn't see. Why?

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.600
Why are you so nervous?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:07.680
What's wrong?

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:10.680
I

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:14.080
left my compass at school.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:15.800
I can't do my math homework.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.120
I'll borrow one from a classmate.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.400
You're leaving just like that?

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.480
What's the rush?

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.160
Whose place are you going to?

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:30.880
Don't worry.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.280
I'll be right back.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.240
Whose place?

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:34.760
Whose place?

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.600
Come home early!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.400
To find Su Lin,

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.120
I called in every favor I could.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.160
City Daily.

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:19.720
Tomorrow's proof.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:27.160
(Canal Case Open)
Weihong Canal case and Lin

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.280
(Victim Identified)
aren't linked.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.280
Feel better now?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:33.080
That dead girl wasn't Lin.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:35.360
Then is there any news about her?

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:36.640
Right.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.680
I nearly forgot.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.280
Your son's home, right?

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:41.720
Su Zhe!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.520
Come out here.

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:43.840
See what I brought you.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.200
Mr. Ma, you shouldn't have.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.280
Why not?

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:55.600
I bought the boy something.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.320
Are you happy at school?

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:00.520
Yes.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:03.320
I bought this to celebrate
you starting school,

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:04.280
as a special present.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.240
Do you like it?

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:06.400
I love it!

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:07.720
Su Zhe.

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:08.600
Come.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.720
What a good boy.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:11.880
Give it back to him, okay?

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:13.640
Give it back.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:14.160
Why?

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:14.840
Give it back.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.560
We can't accept this.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:17.720
Why not?

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.720
It's just a present.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.280
We really can't accept it.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.440
Su Zhe, give it back.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.560
Go on, give it back.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:24.240
Okay, okay.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.360
If you don't want it,

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.560
I can take it back anytime.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.040
Su Zhe.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:33.720
You can keep it.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:35.600
Say thank you.

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:36.800
Thank you, Mr. Ma.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:38.960
Go play.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:40.760
Thank you, Mr. Ma.

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:41.720
This...

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.000
(City Daily)
No need to thank me.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.000
I understand how you feel.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.080
We're all parents, right?

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.400
Everyone I could spare

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:56.480
is out looking.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:58.360
And I heard there's

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.960
a concert in Yancheng soon.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.200
All young people will go see the stars.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:05.920
Maybe Su Lin

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.160
will join the crowd too.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.400
That's possible.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:14.920
I've sent people there.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:17.280
So what are you still worried about?

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.880
Leave Lin to me.

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:21.600
Once I hear anything,

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:22.960
I'll tell you both.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.000
Okay. Good.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:24.520
All right?

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.080
Don't worry.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:27.800
You need to understand,

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:30.160
Na and I

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:31.920
feel exactly as you do.

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:34.080
We want Lin found soon too,

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.520
so we can move past this.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:36.880
- Right?
- Yes, of course.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:38.600
Here.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:47.920
Happy with the school?

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.680
It's the best in the city.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.400
School's really changed your son.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.840
Compared to my last visit,

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.440
he's like a different kid.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:02.640
Isn't life

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:03.960
getting better bit by bit?

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.080
Go inside.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:43.440
Honey.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:45.640
I just remembered.

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:47.640
Lin mentioned buying a tape.

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:50.280
Could the tape she mentioned

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:52.000
have something to do with music?

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:55.080
Why don't we go to Yancheng tomorrow?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.040
Don't you get it?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.640
He made himself perfectly clear.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:04.040
He knows we're looking for her.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:05.400
He warned us.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.840
Keep looking, and things'll get ugly.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.880
We're her parents. We have to look.

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:11.720
I know.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.200
Honey.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.560
Listen to me.

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:15.920
Any lead we get,

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.280
we have to follow it.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.080
Honey.

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.400
A girl her age.

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:21.520
What if she's hurt?

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.240
We couldn't bear it.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.720
Please think of something.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:28.520
Honey.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.000
Think of something.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:35.520
What are you doing?

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:37.920
Buying liquor.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:38.960
The good stuff.

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.280
Fixing the pipes.

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.080
Buying a washer.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.400
Replacing what we need.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.080
Are you crazy?

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.440
We can't spend it.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:46.840
I'm telling you,

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.520
what if Lin was

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:52.040
killed by Ma's daughter?

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.040
If we spend this money,

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.120
we're finished.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:57.600
Does it matter now?

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:01.400
He already paid our fine.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:02.800
Either way,

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:05.400
he can still come after us.

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:06.240
Give it.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:07.480
Give it!

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:08.320
No!

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.400
What are you doing?

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.440
You can't!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.040
Give it!

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.720
No! You can't!

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:33.060
(Follow-up on the 7th;
Water plants on Tuesday)

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.000
(Water plants on Tuesday)

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:54.640
Su Lin.

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.700
(Su Lin)

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:57.640
Dropped out of school.

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:00.560
Odd.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:03.400
(Su Zhe)
Brother

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:05.280
suddenly started school.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:06.520
Odd.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.300
(Su Zhe)

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.000
(Mrs. Su)
Mrs. Su said she's away

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:12.720
visiting relatives.

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:14.560
Odd.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:16.800
(Homemaker)

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.400
Four people in the family,

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.680
but only three bowls.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:24.360
Odd.

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.320
(Child outside family planning rules)
The unregistered child

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.360
suddenly starts school at ten.

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:29.360
(Su Zhe in school: Odd)

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.120
Odd.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.040
(Mr. Ma)
A businessman showed up.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:38.600
(Mr. Ma: A businessman)
Why did he come?

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:39.760
Odd.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:49.640
You scared me!

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:54.160
Still won't let yourself rest?

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:55.560
How did you get in?

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.720
I knocked. You didn't hear me.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:58.960
Too wrapped up in the case.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:00.400
Key's under the mat.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.200
I let myself in.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:08.680
Why are you hiding it?

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.320
It's not a case.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:14.720
Fine.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:16.520
I'll read it when you're done.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.760
You'll let me read it, right?

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:20.400
Of course.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.440
I haven't worked it out yet.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:23.920
I'm afraid you'll laugh at me.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.040
Here. Have some water.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.120
This is why you're so run-down?

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:31.440
Who's run-down?

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:39.600
There's a blanket on the couch.

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.560
So you sleep there sometimes.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:45.320
There's a massage mallet on the table.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.080
So you get muscle aches too.

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.160
That's what Tai Wei found about you.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:53.360
That kid.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:56.000
One visit here,

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.640
and he finds all that evidence.

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.800
You two trained him from childhood.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:05.960
His father trained him well.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:12.920
Tai Wei said

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.960
you sometimes forget things now.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.000
He asked me to stop by.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:16.760
I don't.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:18.600
I'm not that useless.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:21.640
You don't need me or want me here?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.520
Don't need you.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:23.720
No.

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:25.520
Of course you're welcome here.

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.160
There's a box by the door.

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:31.160
Bring it in.

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:40.400
It's so heavy.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.240
You need some vitamin C.

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.440
Look at this place.

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:49.160
Not even fruit for your guests.

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:50.440
Wait.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:52.040
How'd you carry something so heavy?

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.600
You were supposed to pick it up.

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:55.880
But you wouldn't go.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:58.080
You said you were busy.

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:59.680
You look pretty free now.

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:01.440
Thank you.

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:05.240
I'm leaving.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:06.680
Stay a little.

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:08.280
Stay a bit.

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:14.280
Won't you walk me out?

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:15.840
Oh, I am.

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:28.400
Hello?

00:22:30.040 --> 00:22:30.520
Hello?

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:53.800
Hello?

00:22:54.240 --> 00:22:55.320
Did you just call me?

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:57.240
No.

00:22:57.800 --> 00:22:58.360
Yes, you did.

00:22:58.760 --> 00:22:59.440
Listen.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.960
My new phone

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:02.120
has caller ID.

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:05.120
Wrong number.

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:06.920
It was a mistake.

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:09.080
Jiang Yushu.

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:10.640
What's going on?

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:15.480
Is Ting all right?

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.000
Ting is fine.

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:18.000
She's great.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:19.840
We're all great.

00:23:20.840 --> 00:23:21.600
Not your business.

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:50.360
Come in.

00:24:00.760 --> 00:24:01.480
Where were you?

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:03.920
Look at you.

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:07.080
I asked you a question.

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:08.880
Where were you?

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:14.680
Can you hear me?

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:16.240
I'm talking to you.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:17.920
What were you doing?

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:19.440
How did you end up like this?

00:24:20.200 --> 00:24:21.120
What happened?

00:24:21.120 --> 00:24:22.400
Can you tell me?

00:24:22.840 --> 00:24:24.520
Look at the time.

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:25.880
It's 10:30 p.m.

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:26.960
Do you have any idea?

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:28.680
I've been waiting in this room.

00:24:28.840 --> 00:24:30.000
You didn't take your key.

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:31.480
I couldn't go out,

00:24:31.640 --> 00:24:33.080
and I couldn't just sit here.

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:35.240
I was worried sick.

00:24:35.440 --> 00:24:37.640
Can't you understand how I felt?

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:39.200
Where were you?

00:24:44.800 --> 00:24:46.000
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:24:50.200 --> 00:24:51.640
I'll go wash my hands.

00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:54.080
Make it up if you must,

00:24:54.600 --> 00:24:55.960
you will give me an answer.

00:24:56.640 --> 00:24:57.880
What did you do?

00:24:58.040 --> 00:24:59.080
Where did you go?

00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:08.480
Mom, I'm not lying.

00:25:10.440 --> 00:25:12.360
I really just fell down.

00:25:14.000 --> 00:25:15.480
I'll change my clothes.

00:25:16.520 --> 00:25:17.560
I need a shower.

00:26:00.440 --> 00:26:01.840
(What are you looking at? Get lost!)

00:26:07.960 --> 00:26:08.520
(Go!)

00:26:09.240 --> 00:26:10.120
(Hurry!)

00:26:12.960 --> 00:26:13.520
(Go!)

00:26:13.920 --> 00:26:14.880
(Hurry!)

00:28:10.440 --> 00:28:12.040
I'm locked inside!

00:28:12.400 --> 00:28:13.120
Open the door!

00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:15.880
Is anyone there?

00:28:16.240 --> 00:28:17.320
Is anyone out there?

00:28:21.000 --> 00:28:21.960
Open the door!

00:28:22.440 --> 00:28:23.120
Open up!

00:28:44.480 --> 00:28:45.920
(What our eyes see,)

00:28:46.720 --> 00:28:47.920
(what our ears hear,)

00:28:49.000 --> 00:28:50.160
(and what we experience,)

00:28:51.920 --> 00:28:53.480
(is any of it truly real?)

00:29:09.880 --> 00:29:10.920
You've got old injuries.

00:29:10.920 --> 00:29:11.880
On your leg too.

00:29:12.400 --> 00:29:14.240
Every callout scares me to death.

00:29:15.120 --> 00:29:16.640
I just want you to consider it.

00:29:16.920 --> 00:29:18.600
You can crack big cases on desk duty

00:29:18.640 --> 00:29:19.840
and still make a difference.

00:29:21.400 --> 00:29:21.920
No way.

00:29:22.480 --> 00:29:23.360
After we crack this.

00:29:25.760 --> 00:29:26.240
Fine.

00:29:26.680 --> 00:29:27.840
Forget I said anything.

00:29:28.720 --> 00:29:29.480
But one thing,

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:31.680
train the rookies well.

00:29:32.480 --> 00:29:33.560
You may not feel old,

00:29:33.640 --> 00:29:34.840
but face the fact.

00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:36.280
We need more young officers.

00:29:36.800 --> 00:29:37.280
Mr. Gu.

00:29:37.320 --> 00:29:38.720
I need the last two years' files.

00:29:39.200 --> 00:29:40.040
You again, kid?

00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:41.480
You came two days ago.

00:29:43.040 --> 00:29:44.320
My apprentice needs no help.

00:29:44.720 --> 00:29:45.800
He's quicker than I am.

00:29:49.000 --> 00:29:49.480
Director Hu.

00:29:49.880 --> 00:29:50.280
Captain.

00:29:51.000 --> 00:29:53.040
Weren't you checking on Yang Xinqian?

00:29:53.160 --> 00:29:54.040
Why are you here?

00:29:54.040 --> 00:29:55.280
I have a feeling.

00:29:55.400 --> 00:29:56.120
The three victims' jobs

00:29:56.120 --> 00:29:57.640
have almost nothing in common.

00:29:58.080 --> 00:29:59.160
The crimes seem random.

00:29:59.320 --> 00:30:01.040
If it's purely sexual,

00:30:01.040 --> 00:30:02.840
the killer is probably low-income.

00:30:02.960 --> 00:30:04.360
So I want to check the files

00:30:04.400 --> 00:30:05.600
of people with recent priors.

00:30:11.600 --> 00:30:12.800
I pulled them for you.

00:30:13.360 --> 00:30:14.120
Keep digging.

00:30:15.120 --> 00:30:16.560
I like people

00:30:16.680 --> 00:30:18.040
who thinks like the captain.

00:30:21.640 --> 00:30:23.200
And then mounted,

00:30:23.400 --> 00:30:25.560
with the other children of the air...

00:30:25.960 --> 00:30:26.800
And then mounted,

00:30:26.840 --> 00:30:28.840
with the other

00:30:28.840 --> 00:30:31.040
children of the air...

00:30:31.240 --> 00:30:32.520
To a rosy cloud...

00:30:33.280 --> 00:30:35.080
To a rosy cloud...

00:30:35.440 --> 00:30:38.160
That floated through the ether.

00:30:38.520 --> 00:30:41.880
That floated through the ether.

00:30:44.520 --> 00:30:45.120
Everyone.

00:30:45.960 --> 00:30:47.360
Your pronunciation in that passage

00:30:47.360 --> 00:30:48.240
still needs work.

00:30:48.840 --> 00:30:49.960
You all need more practice.

00:30:50.960 --> 00:30:53.200
Now form groups and practice.

00:30:53.480 --> 00:30:54.240
Remember,

00:30:54.840 --> 00:30:56.080
you must show the emotion.

00:30:56.800 --> 00:30:58.080
Look into each other's eyes.

00:30:58.440 --> 00:30:59.000
You can even

00:30:59.240 --> 00:31:00.120
hold hands.

00:31:00.520 --> 00:31:01.160
Because

00:31:01.200 --> 00:31:03.000
pronunciation can be corrected,

00:31:03.040 --> 00:31:04.440
but only genuine emotion

00:31:04.840 --> 00:31:06.160
can truly move an audience.

00:31:08.240 --> 00:31:09.520
All right. Begin.

00:31:09.840 --> 00:31:11.040
Okay.

00:31:11.120 --> 00:31:12.400
Come on. Let's review.

00:31:13.520 --> 00:31:14.400
Stop laughing.

00:31:14.800 --> 00:31:15.640
Sorry.

00:31:16.760 --> 00:31:17.480
What's that smell?

00:31:22.520 --> 00:31:22.960
Yang Le.

00:31:23.800 --> 00:31:24.360
Come here.

00:31:24.600 --> 00:31:25.840
Change the camera battery.

00:31:26.000 --> 00:31:27.800
I'll get two spares from the office.

00:31:28.240 --> 00:31:29.040
Yes, Mr. Zhou.

00:31:31.720 --> 00:31:33.480
Practice on your own for now.

00:31:40.360 --> 00:31:41.800
Let me see what you're reading.

00:31:43.400 --> 00:31:44.160
Read it to me.

00:31:44.720 --> 00:31:45.640
Maybe not.

00:31:49.960 --> 00:31:50.440
All right.

00:31:50.480 --> 00:31:52.200
Where should we start?

00:31:55.080 --> 00:31:56.200
Wait a second.

00:31:56.400 --> 00:31:57.360
I'll put my bag away.

00:31:57.480 --> 00:31:58.360
I'll be right back.

00:32:24.740 --> 00:32:27.420
(32 Su Lin)

00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:02.200
Ms. Wang.

00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:06.480
Could I...

00:33:07.120 --> 00:33:08.320
Well.

00:33:08.880 --> 00:33:10.800
Since Su Lin dropped out,

00:33:10.800 --> 00:33:12.200
could I use her locker?

00:33:12.480 --> 00:33:13.920
I still don't have one.

00:33:15.160 --> 00:33:16.040
Su Lin, right?

00:33:17.160 --> 00:33:17.880
Number 32.

00:33:17.880 --> 00:33:18.320
Thirty...

00:33:20.320 --> 00:33:20.720
Here.

00:33:21.040 --> 00:33:21.840
Thank you.

00:34:04.800 --> 00:34:06.920
(The Little Mermaid)

00:34:16.720 --> 00:34:18.280
The little mermaid

00:34:18.840 --> 00:34:19.760
lifted her...

00:34:20.760 --> 00:34:21.840
Everyone's holding hands.

00:34:24.520 --> 00:34:25.760
Everyone else is practicing.

00:34:25.760 --> 00:34:26.600
Why aren't you?

00:34:28.000 --> 00:34:28.600
It's just

00:34:28.600 --> 00:34:30.720
we practice this all day, every day.

00:34:30.760 --> 00:34:31.520
I'm so sick of it.

00:34:31.520 --> 00:34:32.560
What's the point?

00:34:34.680 --> 00:34:35.720
Check out my new nails.

00:34:36.480 --> 00:34:37.720
Well? Aren't they pretty?

00:34:43.640 --> 00:34:44.040
I mean

00:34:44.040 --> 00:34:45.600
it's just too noisy here.

00:34:45.600 --> 00:34:46.480
I can't focus.

00:34:47.040 --> 00:34:48.480
I know somewhere quiet. Come on.

00:34:49.960 --> 00:34:50.680
What are you doing?

00:34:50.760 --> 00:34:51.680
Are you practicing?

00:34:52.280 --> 00:34:53.400
It's quieter here.

00:34:53.640 --> 00:34:55.280
You can put real emotion into it.

00:34:55.520 --> 00:34:56.800
And Mr. Zhou said

00:34:57.080 --> 00:34:58.840
when we practice,

00:34:58.840 --> 00:35:00.280
we should hold each other's hands.

00:35:00.560 --> 00:35:01.080
Let's start.

00:35:07.160 --> 00:35:08.360
The little mermaid

00:35:08.440 --> 00:35:09.760
lifted her glorified eyes...

00:35:09.760 --> 00:35:11.000
Look into my eyes.

00:35:17.720 --> 00:35:18.840
The little mermaid...

00:35:18.840 --> 00:35:19.720
More feeling.

00:35:19.720 --> 00:35:20.960
Are you practicing or not?

00:35:21.280 --> 00:35:22.440
I am.

00:35:23.280 --> 00:35:25.840
Since you're so shy,

00:35:26.240 --> 00:35:27.000
I'll go first.

00:35:28.800 --> 00:35:30.480
The little mermaid

00:35:30.960 --> 00:35:36.960
lifted her glorified eyes
towards the son.

00:35:41.960 --> 00:35:43.680
It's "sun," not "son."

00:35:43.760 --> 00:35:44.440
Close enough.

00:35:44.760 --> 00:35:46.400
Then your version means

00:35:46.680 --> 00:35:47.560
the little mermaid

00:35:47.600 --> 00:35:49.760
lifted her eyes to her son.

00:35:50.720 --> 00:35:51.840
I'm practicing.

00:35:51.880 --> 00:35:53.560
Don't break my concentration.

00:35:55.640 --> 00:35:58.760
And felt them, for the first time...

00:35:58.760 --> 00:35:59.360
Mr. Zhou.

00:35:59.480 --> 00:36:00.920
"filling with tears."

00:36:02.000 --> 00:36:02.520
What is it?

00:36:05.120 --> 00:36:06.240
Do you have

00:36:06.240 --> 00:36:07.520
Su Lin's contact information?

00:36:08.280 --> 00:36:09.320
She left some things

00:36:09.320 --> 00:36:10.480
in the locker I'm using.

00:36:11.040 --> 00:36:12.080
I'd like to return them.

00:36:13.000 --> 00:36:13.640
Well.

00:36:13.960 --> 00:36:15.280
I need the restroom.

00:36:21.000 --> 00:36:21.920
I can find

00:36:21.920 --> 00:36:22.840
Su Lin's home number.

00:36:23.040 --> 00:36:23.880
Would that work?

00:36:26.560 --> 00:36:27.360
Thank you.

00:36:27.960 --> 00:36:28.600
You're welcome.

00:36:37.680 --> 00:36:38.280
Sir.

00:36:41.400 --> 00:36:43.120
Do you know why Su Lin dropped out?

00:36:43.880 --> 00:36:45.520
I'm not really sure.

00:36:46.480 --> 00:36:47.360
Thanks for your help.

00:37:32.520 --> 00:37:33.920
(Don't shake a pen with ink in it.)

00:37:34.120 --> 00:37:35.280
(You'll get it on yourself.)

00:37:37.920 --> 00:37:38.880
(A pair of torn shoes.)

00:37:39.320 --> 00:37:41.000
(I can't get a decent night's sleep.)

00:37:41.520 --> 00:37:43.200
(What did I raise you for?)

00:37:46.960 --> 00:37:47.800
Mom.

00:37:48.640 --> 00:37:50.040
When is my sister coming back?

00:38:02.880 --> 00:38:03.520
She

00:38:06.400 --> 00:38:07.760
will probably be back soon.

00:38:09.720 --> 00:38:11.160
That day, I got ink

00:38:11.160 --> 00:38:12.720
on her shoes.

00:38:12.800 --> 00:38:14.000
I didn't mean to.

00:38:16.040 --> 00:38:16.760
I know.

00:38:23.000 --> 00:38:23.960
Is she not coming home

00:38:23.960 --> 00:38:25.480
because she's mad at me?

00:38:25.640 --> 00:38:26.800
Of course not.

00:38:29.000 --> 00:38:30.200
Finish your homework.

00:38:33.080 --> 00:38:34.600
She'll be home soon.

00:38:57.800 --> 00:38:58.560
Mom.

00:39:00.040 --> 00:39:00.920
What's wrong?

00:39:02.000 --> 00:39:02.600
Nothing.

00:39:06.480 --> 00:39:07.160
I'm okay.

00:39:20.440 --> 00:39:21.120
What do you want?

00:39:22.920 --> 00:39:24.960
Didn't we say we'd study after school?

00:39:24.960 --> 00:39:25.480
Let's go.

00:39:25.480 --> 00:39:26.240
I have to go home.

00:39:26.240 --> 00:39:27.160
It's urgent at home.

00:39:27.280 --> 00:39:28.200
I really have to-

00:39:28.640 --> 00:39:29.000
All good.

00:39:29.000 --> 00:39:30.160
There's a chair. Sit.

00:39:30.520 --> 00:39:31.400
Sit down.

00:39:31.400 --> 00:39:32.280
We said sit.

00:39:32.760 --> 00:39:33.600
Didn't you hear us?

00:39:33.680 --> 00:39:34.400
What do you want?

00:39:34.560 --> 00:39:35.480
Let go of me!

00:39:37.200 --> 00:39:37.760
What are you doing?

00:39:37.800 --> 00:39:38.480
Help! Anyone?

00:39:38.520 --> 00:39:39.480
Hey, Jiang Ting.

00:39:42.200 --> 00:39:43.480
Please let me go.

00:39:43.640 --> 00:39:44.840
Getting impatient?

00:39:46.320 --> 00:39:47.240
Today's on me.

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:55.920
I picked my favorite flavor for you.

00:39:56.160 --> 00:39:57.680
Somebody help me!

00:39:57.880 --> 00:39:59.280
I told you to mind your business.

00:39:59.880 --> 00:40:01.200
Why did you go to Zhou Xijie?

00:40:05.320 --> 00:40:05.920
Talk!

00:40:06.560 --> 00:40:08.280
Why are you looking for Su Lin?

00:40:15.320 --> 00:40:16.680
That's what you get for snooping.

00:40:18.840 --> 00:40:20.920
Why did you have to go
looking for Zhou Xijie?

00:40:21.760 --> 00:40:22.520
Does it hurt?

00:40:23.920 --> 00:40:24.560
Stay back!

00:40:24.760 --> 00:40:25.600
Don't come closer!

00:40:27.160 --> 00:40:28.960
Stay back!

00:40:29.040 --> 00:40:30.280
It's a dead end.

00:40:30.680 --> 00:40:31.720
Where can you run?

00:40:32.280 --> 00:40:33.120
Not bad.

00:40:34.880 --> 00:40:35.520
Stay back!

00:40:35.560 --> 00:40:37.320
Stay back!

00:40:38.560 --> 00:40:39.360
A compass.

00:40:40.000 --> 00:40:41.560
Come on. Stab me.

00:40:41.680 --> 00:40:42.640
Stay back!

00:40:56.720 --> 00:40:57.520
Don't come!

00:40:58.200 --> 00:40:59.080
Don't!

00:41:02.140 --> 00:41:05.060
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

00:41:05.560 --> 00:41:06.040
Young girl.

00:41:07.400 --> 00:41:08.520
Could I have a moment?

00:41:09.000 --> 00:41:09.760
I wanted to ask

00:41:10.320 --> 00:41:11.240
if you know a student

00:41:11.280 --> 00:41:12.200
named Su Lin.

00:41:13.800 --> 00:41:14.360
Keep running.

00:41:14.440 --> 00:41:15.000
Stay back!

00:41:15.600 --> 00:41:16.040
Stay back!

00:41:19.440 --> 00:41:20.400
What are you doing?

00:41:24.840 --> 00:41:25.760
This tape

00:41:26.720 --> 00:41:29.280
recorded everything
that has just happened here.

00:41:51.900 --> 00:41:57.780
♪A faint heartbeat, scales drifting♪

00:41:58.100 --> 00:42:03.620
♪In briny dark, scorched gills appear♪

00:42:04.100 --> 00:42:09.540
♪An empty shell, a banished soul♪

00:42:10.060 --> 00:42:15.220
♪Moonlight splinters into shards♪

00:42:15.980 --> 00:42:19.380
♪Don't look back, don't look back♪

00:42:21.780 --> 00:42:27.020
